<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 2.61 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rise to 2.61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose slightly to 2.61 percent on Saturday from 2.47 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said six banks traded on the market in 14 reported transactions with a total value of 21.5 million dinars ($30.4 million). Banks close on Friday, the local weekend.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
